Z||000006||Black88GT||05-23-2001||09:35 PM||||College sorority girl is what, 19 at the youngest?  When your 19 you have a pretty good idea of what you like/dislike etc.  But when your 8, you still kinda finding yourself, your likes/dislikes, and your parents play a huge part in that.  My Dad never like to work on cars so I never knew a thing about them until I was 16 and I got my Fiero.  However my Dad loves sports and got me involved with them young.  Parents play a huge part in childrens lives. <P>Again, I am not trying to take anything away from her.  But they even asked the sponsor if gender played a major role in his sponsorship and he said "well I would be lying if I told you it didn't".  It makes sense.  Very marketable.  Don't be surpised if she is like another Anna Kournikova type athlete, that is, not so good but different in a way that makes her a good sponsor (Kournikova is gorgeous, billie jean king on the other hand....)||||reg||1
